TradingAgents Workbench

This is an independent modified distribution of TauricResearch/TradingAgents.
Upstream: https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents
Source baseline: v0.4.0, commit 9dee508c44662702281a8dbaad1f7b42179b5ba7.
Upstream research authors: Yijia Xiao, Edward Sun, Di Luo and Wei Wang.
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.20138

The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0, is retained in LICENSE.
Original source notices, author attribution and applicable artwork are retained.
This distribution is not an official upstream release and is not endorsed by
the upstream authors or by any model, data, cloud or chart provider.

Modifications include a local/hosted research workbench, isolated account state,
provider gateway and execution coordination, saved assistant conversations,
market charts, owner administration, interface/build sources and tests.
This public distribution replaces installation-specific identifiers with
examples and excludes personal data, credentials and operational histories.
Modified source files carry a change notice where their format permits one;
example configuration, deployment templates and tests are distribution changes.
The fresh repository history is not the full upstream development history.

Bundled third-party software remains under its own licenses. Full redistributed
license texts are in licenses/ and are indexed by THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

